[{"id":"cnm_242_q1","topicId":"cnm_242","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"矩形面积 12，长 y 与宽 x 的函数关系？下列哪一个正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"y=12x"},{"key":"B","text":"y=x/12"},{"key":"C","text":"y=12/x（x>0）"},{"key":"D","text":"y=12-x"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"面积=长×宽，xy=12，所以 y=12/x，且宽 x>0。"},{"id":"cnm_242_q2","topicId":"cnm_242","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"加工一批零件共 600 个，每天加工 x 个，需要 y 天，则 y=600/x。当每天加工 40 个时，需要多少天？","answer":"15","explanation":"总量一定，y=600/x，x=40 时 y=600÷40=15 天。","verify":"600//40"},{"id":"cnm_242_q3","topicId":"cnm_242","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"压力一定时，压强 p（Pa）与受力面积 S（m²）成反比例。当 S=0.2 时 p=500，求 S=0.5 时 p 的值。（单位：Pa）","answer":"200","explanation":"p=k/S，k=0.2×500=100，所以 p=100/S，S=0.5 时 p=100/0.5=200。","verify":"Fraction(2,10)*500/Fraction(5,10)"},{"id":"cnm_242_q4","topicId":"cnm_242","difficulty":"advanced","type":"numeric","prompt":"一个水池容积为 60 m³，用水泵注水，注水速度为 v m³/h，注满所需时间为 t h。若要求在 4 小时内（t≤4）注满，注水速度 v 至少是多少 m³/h？","answer":"15","explanation":"vt=60，t=60/v。t≤4，即 60/v≤4，v>0，所以 v≥15，至少 15 m³/h。","verify":"60//4"}]
